{#
  Cẩm Thạch — luxury hotel ballroom: white marble, rose-gold metal, Art Deco geometry.
  Every ornament is a lean SVG used as a CSS mask and painted with the theme colours:
    marble.svg (vector veining, no filters → cheap to paint), fan.svg (sunburst), rule.svg,
    scales.svg (fan-scale lattice on the doors), corner.svg (hero frame corner, rotated in CSS),
    dc-tl/tr/bl/br.svg (22px stepped notches drawn 1:1 so they meet the CSS frame lines exactly).
  Overrides: sections/hero.njk (ballroom portal) and partials/intro-decor.njk (plaque crown).
#}
{% extends "layout.njk" %}

{% block background %}
<div class="lm-marble" aria-hidden="true"><i class="lm-marble__veins"></i><i class="lm-marble__gold"></i></div>
{% endblock %}

{% block sections %}
  {% for section in sections %}
    {% include "sections/" + section + ".njk" %}
    {% if section != 'hero' and not loop.last %}
    <div class="lm-sep" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
{% endblock %}
